// "Amass <subtype> N" with its reminder text [CR#701.47a]: "If you don't
// control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black <subtype> Army creature token.
// Choose an Army creature you control. Put N +1/+1 counters on that creature.
// If it isn't a <subtype>, it becomes a <subtype> in addition to its other
// types." "You" is the actor: whoever performs the action, the controller
// unless a handoff names another player. Lean `Actor.amass`, which reads
// "that creature" and "it" through `itPrior`; this body reads them bare, as
// the Lean pin `okLiteralAmassBare` spells it. The action is wrapped as the
// deed "Amass", so "whenever you amass" and "the Army you amassed" have a
// deed to name [CR#701.47b,701.47c]. The amassed subtype is
// typed `Subtype` rather than Lean's own `String` (it is spliced into a
// `Vec<Subtype>` position twice, which no `String` value can fill).
KeywordAction(
    name: "amass",
    params: [Subtype, Amount],
    spelling: "amass",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "amass",
        third_person: "amasses",
        frame_set: Custom(frames: [[ObjectNounPhrase, Amount]]),
    ),
    body: sequentially([
        // "If you don't control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black
        // <subtype> Army creature token."
        doIf(
            not(exists(and([hasSubtype(army), creature, actorControls]))),
            createToken(actor, creatureToken(0, 0, [Black], [Param(0), army])),
        ),
        // "Choose an Army creature you control."
        choose(actor, a(and([hasSubtype(army), creature, actorControls]))),
        // "Put N +1/+1 counters on that creature."
        putCounters(Param(1), p1p1Counter, that(Creature)),
        // "If it isn't a <subtype>, it becomes a <subtype> in addition to its
        // other types."
        doIf(
            not(matches(it, hasSubtype(Param(0)))),
            establish(addSubtype(it, Param(0))),
        ),
    ]),
)
